    Takes inputs: {'numerator': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'The part value.'}, 'denominator': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'The whole value; must be non-zero.'}, 'round_to_int': {'type': 'boolean', 'nullable': True, 'description': 'When *True* (default) round to nearest whole percent and append "%".  Otherwise return the raw float as a string.'}}
    Returns an output of type: string
